{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣《第61屆戲劇類金鐘獎頒獎典禮》戲劇類男主角獎由莊凱勛憑《都市開基祖》撼低周渝民、曾敬驊等奪得，這亦是他時隔11年二度稱帝，他大表不敢置信，並指知道今次對手都很厲害，以為自己今次只是來拍拍手、微笑，估不到自己能奪獎，感到很開心及榮幸。</p><p>周</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:24.991400+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:10:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:43.189164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:43.189164+00:00","content_hash":"7004b4ceb8f5a8f204387fee79c4afe0506336a2e9845efc22b386017927e660","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}